      "body": "ACK 1e0c407377034e9cbb4d52f1f534c06cdf202a36\n\nbuilt and tested on macos/arm64, clauded up a test that send an \"exceptional\" byte on master and compared to branch. Came to same conclusions as vasild in https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36665/changes#r4378669650\n\nThis is a clean solution to the discrepency\n\n<details><summary>Show Signature</summary>\n\n```\n-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----\nHash: SHA256\n\nACK 1e0c407377034e9cbb4d52f1f534c06cdf202a36\n-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAEBCAA5FiEE5hdzzW4BBA4vG9eM5+KYS2KJyToFAmrfd18bFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOfimEtiick6ZDoP/2oRg7qiKLHVahwfPfyd\nTktDRlqitdF0hhqRtUPwTFJ5M2X14pM5bSEKf67B+FprjdSDfAGLmwm59QCsAyMJ\nFB/8+9KvGuYKt4V3S18LjNskPTzS9sjx/sb2QJsjNFnvl366XhYQnKe9awA/JHsg\nFPg1slp035Z0+qikkwvqtPMIGi+ZGwh0+RAAn46rvjIb0NP2KF4tpTnmfwPr87QK\nvlSCDm7bBN1OpnAy1dc0SqUATl3g12YJiSNQdOCsN9clJv/P3c9Fb3yjg3uNdY2B\nN0+y/NGyYWI6XNimIK9DDaz9kzQCjd2P4XniUm074VHFZODuA1CsyZsuPr7oebkO\nXFvBr4Y72ErrlCmpuquM1rtgbkIXrw4mKwc+W0YOmEYTPx1TxT91mtkV/Za/zTk3\nXCpPl4sCCeE2RGVDdvNgijIcjvNT9lnZIktM8cqMkP7vPapWoUslQ/1iOb/2PPGM\nhMWJ77+Htlpu1FNL7/HKhbkEsaUOY0a8r+wgqenhjHV1hihi+M0TbNdLrj0sQxz6\nIQv3JWk6vq1aA32y+aPahM6v1EJl7qLcjkTMaQtMzM13KW9fakPZeyzqtXP0MLAX\nD74B1n2M+f205gx+Kg6xZg0xxNsrEbKbG743yZn6U6axMZoP98zmiX37A0iDPpaM\nRjTHsecfylVeKOEfff91uw2J\n=/uZl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n```\n\npinheadmz's public key is [on openpgp.org](https://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/E61773CD6E01040E2F1BD78CE7E2984B6289C93A)\n</details>\n",
